"P2307412981" "Lost theft ledger"
// DetailString :
"P217789866" "You found this large list of stolen high tech items in a crate in the Lost's stolen goods depot. It has entries for a large variety and quantity of high-tech parts. Not the kind of thing you'd normally associate with the Lost. The orders for them to steal this stuff came from somewhere else, and from the looks of things they've sent a great deal ahead to whoever asked for it. There are no clues, however, to the stolen goods' final destination."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3376609089" "The Lost have struck again. This time they're raiding a Crey Industries laboratory. There are a lot of people in danger, and if Crey's own security forces get there before the situation is under control, it could erupt into chaos. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you stop this Lost attack?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P766181298" "Stop the Lost attack"
// SendOffString :
"P3931442792" "If you can defeat all of the Lost, great. If you can get the researchers out and take down the boss, then Crey security can probably handle the rest. Either way will win this one."

