"P1906516677" "I can't believe it! A Rikti trooper giving orders to the Lost? The ramifications of all of this are astounding. How long have the Lost been working with the Rikti. Or maybe the Lost have just been a front for the Rikti all along. I don't know which frightens me more. You may have done everyone a major favor by uncovering this, {HeroName}. I just hope you put a stop to whatever they were planning."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_Rikti_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3743543878" "I've got a huge problem with the Lost, {HeroName}, and I think you can help me out. It seems the Lost are forcing other homeless people to take the strange mutagen that turns them into grotesque creatures. Maybe they think they're doing those people a favor, or maybe they're acting purely out of malice. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Either way, you've got to stop the Lost from forcing their mutagen on others.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1993504448" "Stop the Lost from forcing their mutagen on others"
// SendOffString :
"P787134905" "I hate to think of Paragon citizens turned being turned into monsters. I'm counting on you to put a stop to it."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2198352886" "Combat the Lost"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3356066034" "From what I hear, the Lost are still forcing that strange mutagen of theirs on others."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2209164564" "You have discouraged the Lost from forcing their strange mutagen on others."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3281792699" "Sometimes it's easy to forget, but under their huge muscles and strange behavior, the Lost are still human beings. Thanks for stopping them from forcing their fate upon others, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_Rikti_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3958690304" "Workers in Terra Volta have been reporting lots of Lost activity lately. I don't know what they're up to in there, but when their numbers get high, they can be a major threat. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to go to Terra Volta and combat the Lost skulking there.</A> Can you handle it?"
// AcceptString :
"P639558388" "Go to Terra Volta and combat The Lost"
// SendOffString :
