// IntroString :
"P1689567518" "This really worries me. The Lost have been seen scavenging around the Terra Volta reactor itself, and fighting other villains. The workers in the reactor complex are very worried that the Lost might cause some damage to the reactor itself, and they're asking for heroes to fight Lost scavengers in the area. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you travel to Terra Volta and show the Lost that they're not welcome in that area?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2270361437" "Go to Terra Volta and show the Lost they're not welcome"
// SendOffString :
"P2550801632" "The Lost could cause a lot of damage in their search for things to scavenge. If that's even what they're doing."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1062561644" "You need to go to Terra Volta and defeat the Lost."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1556057144" "You have cleared enough of the Lost from Terra Volta."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
